T:I Know That My Redeemer Lives
T:DUKE STREET
C:Music: John Hatton, 1793 · Words: Samuel Medley, 1775
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: "The Church Hymnal, Revised and Enlarged" (Episcopal), 1905. Hymn 132. Setting quite similar to "Songs of Pilgrimage" 1888 hymns 76-79. Melody cross-checked against the hymnary.org score (hymnary.org/tune/duke_street_hatton): 100% of pitches and 100% of note lengths agree.
